  (text "NFC batteryless e-ink tag" (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 4 4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3541dd64-d6b2-424a-9d14-289ef12c51c7))
  (text "Recommended design: NT3H2211 (ISO 14443-A harvest + SRAM pass-through)\\n+ STM32G071CBT6 + TPS61023 + GDEY042T81 4.2 in 400x300.\\nPhone field powers the board. MCU streams the image, paints the panel, then the rail collapses." (at 20 32 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5d908344-bc30-4ce4-bc4f-328dd1b52274))
  (text "Session: couple phone to the bezel antenna -> harvest charges VSTORE ->\\nboost reaches 3.3 V -> supervisor releases PF2-NRST -> MCU boots ->\\nSRAM mailbox drain over I2C -> enable EPD rail -> SSD1683 refresh -> deep sleep / field gone." (at 20 52 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9b346370-58fd-40a4-ae59-23f5505263e4))
  (text "Do not hang bulk capacitance on NTAG VOUT. NXP limits that pin to 220 nF.\\nCharge the tank through R1 (22 ohm) and a Schottky. Keep the phone on the coil for the whole refresh." (at 20 72 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 25510c5b-3cc6-4a16-95bb-f9fd8934b8d7))
  (text "Board outline equals the GDEY042T81 module (91 mm x 77 mm).\\nRoute a 2-turn Class-1 loop in the bezel; keep copper pour out of the antenna keepout.\\nSee README.md for alternate designs (ST25DV, FM1280 module, 2.13 in, 5.83 in)." (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 98be4922-9799-407c-9a28-3eb0bbe7ea47))
